  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. • Finely chop garlic. Roughly chop parsley. Roughly chop capsicum into bite-sized chunks. • Drain and rinse butter beans.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80dbf5ad8e6534c49285/step-ee7c0100.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. • Cook veggie mince, soffritto and capsicum, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes. • Add 1/2 the garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80dbf5ad8e6534c49285/step-ca342510.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• To pan, add cannellini beans and All-American spice blend. Cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1 minute. • Add diced tomatoes with garlic &amp; onion, the salt, BBQ sauce and water. Cook, stirring, until well combined, 2-3 minutes. Season with pepper to taste.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80dbf5ad8e6534c49285/step-609a0420.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Sprinkle bean mixture evenly with Cheddar cheese and cover with a lid (or foil). • Bake until thickened and cheese is melted, 10-12 minutes.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80dbf5ad8e6534c49285/step-98513430.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, slice bake-at-home ciabatta in half lengthways, then slice each half diagonally across. • Place the butter and remaining garlic in a small heatproof bowl. Microwave in 10 second bursts until melted. Stir through half the parsley. Season with salt and pepper. • Brush garlic butter over the cut-side of ciabatta slices. • Place ciabatta slices directly on a wire rack in the oven. Bake until golden, 5 minutes.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80dbf5ad8e6534c49285/step-8b5e3640.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide BBQ baked beans and plant-based mince between bowls. • Garnish with remaining parsley. • Serve with garlic bread. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80dbf5ad8e6534c49285/step-b88fb450.jpg"
    }
  ]
